<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family:Inter,sans-serif;background:#F8FAFC;padding:40px 20px;">
  <div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:32px;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;">
    <h2 style="color:#0F172A;margin-top:0;">Confirm Your Crime Alert Subscription</h2>
    <p>Thank you for signing up for crime alerts for ZIP code <strong><%= @subscription.zip_code %></strong>.</p>
    <p>Your subscription is active. You will receive alerts when incidents occur in your area.</p>
    <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0;margin:24px 0;">
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;">
      To unsubscribe at any time, click <%= link_to "unsubscribe", @unsubscribe_url %>.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;">Memphis Police Department &mdash; Community Portal</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
